00ED32  2               ; MX, MY = the mouse
00ED32  2               readmouse:
00ED32  2  AD 00 D5             lda MOUSEX
00ED35  2  85 46                sta MX
00ED37  2  AD 01 D5             lda MOUSEX+1
00ED3A  2  85 47                sta MX+1
00ED3C  2  AD 02 D5             lda MOUSEY
00ED3F  2  85 48                sta MY
