00ED77  2               
00ED77  2               ; T0 = X position that centres A characters between RX0 and RX1:
00ED77  2               ; (RX0 + RX1) / 2 - A * 4
00ED77  2               centrex:
00ED77  2  85 43                sta TMPB
00ED79  2  A5 22                lda RX0
00ED7B  2  18                   clc
00ED7C  2  65 26                adc RX1
00ED7E  2  85 36                sta T0
